'''Defunct Wizardman''' is an [[NPC]] found at the top of {{Zone|The Mountaintop}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. 

== Purpose ==
'''Defunct Wizardman''' serves as an ending to {{NPCSprite|Wizardman}}'s quest, as they tell the player to close [[The Breach]] atop {{Zone|The Mountaintop}}. They only appear after completing {{NPCSprite|Wizardman}}'s final quest cutscene, which is activated from wearing the {{Item|Wizard Face}} and his armor.

